        "Description": "差分目标系列：话事人\rDT(Diverse Targets):The Leaders\r\r关卡目标：\r*消灭雅典娜·萨瓦拉斯，法比恩·曼恩，马蒂奥·佩雷兹和弗兰克·温克尔曼\r奖励目标：\r*回收克朗凯特报告\r*用DAK X2近身击杀所有目标，但需自行寻找该武器\r限制条件：\r*因银行人多眼杂，客户需要你低调行事，隐藏全部躯体\r\rThe Targets:\r*Eliminate Athena Savalas,Fabian Mann,Mateo Perez and Frank Winkelman\rBonus Targets:\r*Retrieve the Cronkite Document\r*Eliminate all targets by using DAK X2(Melee),but you need to find this weapon by yourself\rRestrictions:\r*Because of the crowds,our client need you to be cautious,and HIDE ALL BODIES",
